   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">HDR-clean travel: median ~82 with bright clean whites (p99 ~242), warm shadows (43,35,33), the most saturated sky of the set (84,114,154 / sat 0.46), vivid foliage (0.69), saturation 0.36. Best for: Travel and cityscape frames, forts and palaces against blue sky, blue-hour city skylines, bright destination-wedding venues, drone frames. Punchy - keep Amount at 70-80% on subtle scenes.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
